ere the caseology one comes  in it uses a unique two piece design  that can be tilted from almost straight  up to a flat design which is helpful to  charge devices that don't have magnets  in them the base is lightweight but it  does have a sticky to hold it in place  and the quality is nice and it  definitely looks different compared to  almost every other stand out there which  is a bonus now you do have to buy a mac  safe puck to put into it but that is  also what gets you the fastest charging  speeds possible so i'm going to be  switching to this thing for my desk so  there you guys have it 10 brand new mac  safe accessories for 2022  some of them are new and some are great  updates to previous versions all of them  are linked down below in the video  description so go ahead and check those  out and if you want we have two other  great videos on magsafe accessories  right over there click go ahead and  click above to subscribe if you guys  want to help us reach our goal of 1  million subscribers we would definitely  appreciate it listen max and i'll see  you in the next video  [Music]

